"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangshi-concordance:p004:m0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"殷琰","kind":"person","person_id":"mj8_5ic_4kk_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangshi-concordance:p004:m0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"劉從","kind":"person","person_id":"6v9_6kw_j5b","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangshi-concordance","book_id":"b-nanqishu-027","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-027-wangshi-concordance-ws1508012"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-yinshuyi:p002","text":"時有巫者能見鬼，說帝言貴妃可致。帝大喜，令召之。有少頃，果於帷中見形如平生。帝欲與之言，默然不對。將執手，奄然便歇，帝尤哽恨，於是擬李夫人賦以寄意焉。謝莊作哀策文奏之，帝臥覽讀，起坐流涕曰：「不謂當今復有此才。」都下傳寫，紙墨為之貴。或云，貴妃是殷琰家人入義宣家，義宣敗入宮云。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-011-yinshuyi:p002:m0075","surface":"謝莊","start":75,"end":77,"person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_DBABA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-yinshuyi:p002:m0123","surface":"殷琰","start":123,"end":125,"person_id":"mj8_5ic_4kk_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-yinshuyi:p002:m0128","surface":"義宣","start":128,"end":130,"person_id":"9df_923_1a1","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-yinshuyi:p002:m0132","surface":"義宣","start":132,"end":134,"person_id":"9df_923_1a1","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":2288359,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":62,"last_line":62,"line_start":0,"line_end":139,"raw_start":4135,"raw_end":4274,"raw_character_offsets":[4135,4136,4137,4138,4139,4140,4141,4142,4143,4144,4145,4146,4147,4148,4149,4150,4151,4152,4153,4154,4155,4156,4157,4158,4159,4160,4161,4162,4163,4164,4165,4166,4167,4168,4169,4170,4171,4172,4173,4174,4175,4176,4177,4178,4179,4180,4181,4182,4183,4184,4185,4186,4187,4188,4189,4190,4191,4192,4193,4194,4195,4196,4197,4198,4199,4200,4201,4202,4203,4204,4205,4206,4207,4208,4209,4210,4211,4212,4213,4214,4215,4216,4217,4218,4219,4220,4221,4222,4223,4224,4225,4226,4227,4228,4229,4230,4231,4232,4233,4234,4235,4236,4237,4238,4239,4240,4241,4242,4243,4244,4245,4246,4247,4248,4249,4250,4251,4252,4253,4254,4255,4256,4257,4258,4259,4260,4261,4262,4263,4264,4265,4266,4267,4268,4269,4270,4271,4272,4273],"projection_sha256":"ccaf48087a62cbffd4faf4d116afbde78a0ca4dc68cb18afb20895cd6f839424","editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-011-yinshuyi","book_id":"b-nanshi-011","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-011-yinshuyi-ws2288359"},{"id":"c-songshu-087-yinyan:p001","text":"殷琰，陳郡長平人也。父道鸞，衡陽王義季右軍長史。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-087-yinyan:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"殷琰","kind":"person","person_id":"mj8_5ic_4kk_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-087-yinyan:p001:m0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"道鸞","kind":"person","person_id":"mj8_5ic_4kk","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-087-yinyan:p001:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"義季","kind":"person","person_id":"pon_7ik_t4l","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-songshu-087-yinyan","book_id":"b-songshu-087","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-087-yinyan-ws2069105"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001","text":"時武衞將軍王廣之領軍隸劉勔，攻殷琰於壽陽，傅靈越奔逃，為廣之軍人所生禽，厲聲曰：「我傅靈越也。汝得賊何不即殺。」生送詣勔，勔躬自慰勞，詰其叛逆，對曰：「九州唱義，豈獨在我。」勔又問：「四方阻逆，無戰不禽，主上皆加以曠蕩，即其才用。卿何不早歸天闕，乃逃命草間乎？」靈越答曰：「薛公舉兵淮北，威震天下，不能專任智勇，委付子姪，致敗之由，實在於此。然事之始末，備皆參豫，人生歸於一死，實無面求活。」勔壯其意，送還京師。太宗欲加原宥，靈越辭對如一，終不回改，乃殺之。靈越，清河人也。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"王廣之","kind":"person","person_id":"m4d_lon_pyg","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"劉勔","kind":"person","person_id":"e2r_5iw_ui0_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"殷琰","kind":"person","person_id":"mj8_5ic_4kk_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"傅靈越","kind":"person","person_id":"kfw_r30_lgz","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"廣之","kind":"person","person_id":"m4d_lon_pyg","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:u0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"軍人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"王廣之部下，姓名、人數未詳。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0042","start":42,"end":45,"surface":"傅靈越","kind":"person","person_id":"kfw_r30_lgz","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:u0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"汝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"靈越呼擒獲者；未能定位到具名者。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"勔","kind":"person","person_id":"e2r_5iw_ui0_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"勔","kind":"person","person_id":"e2r_5iw_ui0_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0087","start":87,"end":88,"surface":"勔","kind":"person","person_id":"e2r_5iw_ui0_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:u0111","start":111,"end":112,"surface":"其","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"劉勔泛指前句所說各方被俘者。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0131","start":131,"end":133,"surface":"靈越","kind":"person","person_id":"kfw_r30_lgz","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:u0158","start":158,"end":160,"surface":"子姪","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"靈越泛稱薛安都委任的子姪，未逐一指名，保留群體。"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0196","start":196,"end":197,"surface":"勔","kind":"person","person_id":"e2r_5iw_ui0_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0213","start":213,"end":215,"surface":"靈越","kind":"person","person_id":"kfw_r30_lgz","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue:p001:m0229","start":229,"end":231,"surface":"靈越","kind":"person","person_id":"kfw_r30_lgz","identification_status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-songshu-088-fulingyue","book_id":"b-songshu-088","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-088-fulingyue-ws2069210"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-027-wangshi-concordance","work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-027","source_id":"s-nanqishu-027-wangshi-concordance-ws1508012","source":{"title":"齊二十七其餘王氏具名選句","provider":"Wikisource","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1508012","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1508012","revision_id":1508012,"edition":"維基文庫固定修訂","accessed_on":"2026-11-21","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫授權。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","extent":"齊二十七其餘王氏具名選句","text_scope":"partial_chapter","raw_path":"sources/nanqishu/nanqi027-ws1508012.wikitext","raw_file_sha256":"babad7828a5a97654c1313db5b7a6eb5c19555d5639193051fd8694d9f8ecfcd"}},{"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-011-yinshuyi","work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-011","source_id":"s-nanshi-011-yinshuyi-ws2288359","source":{"title":"南史卷11·宋孝武淑儀殷氏","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2288359","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2288359","revisio